@base = http://localhost:3000

### Zwykły tekst
GET {{base}}/

### Wszystkie pierwiastki (JSON)
GET {{base}}/api/elements
Accept: application/json

### Filtrowanie: query string (boolean)
GET {{base}}/api/elements?metal=true

### Jeden zasób
GET {{base}}/api/elements/8

### HEAD: nagłówki jak przy GET, bez ciała
HEAD {{base}}/api/elements/8

### OPTIONS: nagłówek Allow
OPTIONS {{base}}/api/elements/8

### POST: 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/api/elements
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "atomicNumber": 31,
  "symbol": "Ga",
  "name": "Gal",
  "isMetal": true,
  "discoveredOn": "1875-01-01",
  "density": 5.91
}

### PUT: pełna reprezentacja
PUT {{base}}/api/elements/31
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "atomicNumber": 31,
  "symbol": "Ga",
  "name": "Gal (zaktualizowany)",
  "isMetal": true,
  "discoveredOn": "1875-01-01",
  "density": 5.91
}

### PATCH: zmieniane tylko wskazane pola
PATCH {{base}}/api/elements/31
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Gal","density":5.904}

### DELETE: 204 No Content
DELETE {{base}}/api/elements/31

### 400 Bad Request (błędny parametr)
GET {{base}}/api/elements?metal=tak

### 400 Bad Request (niepoprawny JSON)
POST {{base}}/api/elements
Content-Type: application/json

{"atomicNumber": }

### 404 Not Found
GET {{base}}/api/elements/999

### 405 Method Not Allowed + Allow
DELETE {{base}}/api/elements

### 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{base}}/api/elements
Content-Type: text/plain

nie jest to JSON

### 422 Unprocessable Content
POST {{base}}/api/elements
Content-Type: application/json

{"atomicNumber": 40, "symbol": "Zr", "name": "Cyrkon", "isMetal": "tak", "discoveredOn": "1789-01-01", "density": 6.52}

### 409 Conflict (istniejący identyfikator)
POST {{base}}/api/elements
Content-Type: application/json

{"atomicNumber": 8, "symbol": "Ox", "name": "Test", "isMetal": false, "discoveredOn": null, "density": 1.3}
